# ROM material — never commit (see README disclaimer)
#
# ⚠️ EXTENSION LIST, NOT A PRINCIPLE — keep it ahead of the tooling. Audited
# 2026-08-13 and it had holes exactly where the newest tools work: audiorom.img
# is 13.2 MB of the game's own VADPCM samples, four committed tools read and
# write it, and nothing here stopped a `git add -A` from publishing it.
